    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Attractively located  2 Bedroom Semi-Detached Residence"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Attractively located  2 Bedroom Semi-Detached Residence"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "This Home is located down a quiet cul-de-sac being only a 3-minute walk to Clonakilty town centre, which offers a large selection of amenities and services.\r\n\r\nInternally, this Home extends to approximately 720 Sq.ft. and is presented in excellent condition throughout, having a very fresh and airy presence.\r\n\r\nOn entering the Residence, the Entrance Hall showcases an ornately tiled floor and provides access to the first floor, Living room and Kitchen/Dining area. The Living room features timber flooring and a solid fuel stove benefitting from a Back Boiler heating system. The Kitchen/Dining area features timber flooring, a well laid out kitchen with integrated appliances and an access door to the rear of the property. Both the Living room and Kitchen/Dining area enjoy ample sunlight with large, double-glazed windows to both the front and rear.\r\n\r\nThe First floor comprises of 2 Double bedrooms and a Bathroom with both bedrooms enjoying large, double-glazed windows which provide panoramic views over Clonakilty town.\r\n\r\nThis characterful Residence is set upon an elevated South facing corner plot, which provides both the residence and the wraparound garden ample sunlight throughout the day. The Garden offers a great outdoor space and would be well suited for those with an interest in gardening.\r\n\r\nThis Home offers a great opportunity for those searching for a vibrant and lovingly maintained Home within walking distance of Clonakilty Town centre.\r\n\r\nViewings highly recommended.\r\n\r\nServices:  Mains Water, Mains Drainage, Electricity and both Oil Fired and back boiler Central Heating."
      },
      {
